                title: "How does a ramp tone tint a body?",
                source: "Brief 4b-6 toon ramp (docs/briefs/4b-6-toon-ramp.md)",
                description: r#"Every body must go through the same falloff (owner: so objects don't look so dissimilar), so a ramp stop is a tone applied to the body's own fill, not a colour that replaces it."#,
                decision: true,
                options: [
                    (
