                description: r#"Today the signal graph is a graph wired by bus names (three scene-content resources, 12 block kinds, edited by the canvas through ResMut), and geometry is a materialized SDF tree per body (destructive booleans, no parameters). Graphite is the capability goal; persistence stays RON of materialized authored state; Steel never runs in the frame loop. Detail: docs/graph-model-decision.md."#,
                decision: true,
                options: [
