                        label: "(a) Keep two graphs",
                        caption: r#"Signals stay name-wired resources, shapes stay per-body trees; share node metadata only. Cost: smallest, no format change; but the canvas side door and name wires stay, and parametric shapes later need a second graph (and 3D a third)."#,
